        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>中国7~24月龄婴幼儿平衡膳食宝塔</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = { tex: { inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']] } };\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" async></script>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body {\n    font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"SimHei\", Arial, sans-serif;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 10px;\n    background: #fff;\n    color: #333;\n    font-size: 11px;\n  }\n  .page {\n    max-width: 1000px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    border: 1px solid #ddd;\n    padding: 10px 15px;\n  }\n  /* Header */\n  .header {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    border-bottom: 2px solid #2e7d32;\n    padding-bottom: 8px;\n    margin-bottom: 8px;\n  }\n  .logo-left {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 6px;\n    width: 150px;\n  }\n  .logo-circle {\n    width: 34px;\n    height: 34px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: #eaf3ea;\n    border: 1px solid #2e7d32;\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    font-size: 7px;\n    text-align: center;\n    color: #2e7d32;\n  }\n  .logo-left .text {\n    font-size: 9px;\n    color: #2e7d32;\n    line-height: 1.3;\n  }\n  .title-block {\n    flex: 1;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  .title-block h1 {\n    font-size: 17px;\n    color: #d94f1e;\n    margin: 0;\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n  .title-block .subtitle {\n    font-size: 10px;\n    color: #555;\n    margin-top: 3px;\n  }\n  .logo-right {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 6px;\n    width: 170px;\n    justify-content: flex-end;\n  }\n  .logo-right .text {\n    font-size: 8px;\n    color: #d94f1e;\n    line-height: 1.3;\n    text-align: right;\n  }\n  .logo-square {\n    width: 34px;\n    height: 34px;\n    background: #fdece3;\n    border: 1px solid #d94f1e;\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n    display:flex;\n    align-items:center;\n    justify-content:center;\n    font-size:6px;\n    color:#d94f1e;\n    text-align:center;\n  }\n\n  /* main body layout */\n  .main {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 10px;\n  }\n  .left-col {\n    width: 210px;\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n  }\n  .left-col ul {\n    list-style: none;\n    padding: 0;\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n  .left-col li {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    gap: 5px;\n    margin-bottom: 7px;\n    line-height: 1.3;\n  }\n  .bullet-icon {\n    width: 12px;\n    height: 12px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: #7cb342;\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n    margin-top: 1px;\n  }\n\n  .center-col {\n    flex: 1;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n  .pyramid-placeholder {\n    width: 260px;\n    height: 300px;\n    border: 1px dashed #999;\n    background: repeating-linear-gradient(\n      45deg, #fafafa, #fafafa 10px, #f0f0f0 10px, #f0f0f0 20px\n    );\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n    color: #777;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    padding: 10px;\n  }\n  .pyramid-caption {\n    margin-top: 6px;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n  }\n\n  .right-col {\n    width: 300px;\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n  }\n  .age-headers {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: flex-end;\n    gap: 14px;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    color: #d94f1e;\n    margin-bottom: 4px;\n    padding-right: 4px;\n  }\n  table.diet-table {\n    width: 100%;\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n    font-size: 10px;\n  }\n  table.diet-table th, table.diet-table td {\n    border: 1px solid #ccc;\n    padding: 4px 5px;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  table.diet-table th {\n    background: #fdece3;\n    color: #d94f1e;\n  }\n  table.diet-table td.label {\n    text-align: left;\n    background: #fff8f2;\n    color: #333;\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n  .note-block {\n    margin-top: 10px;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    text-align: center;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n  }\n  .note-block .small {\n    font-size: 9px;\n    color: #555;\n  }\n\n  .footer {\n    margin-top: 12px;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n    border-top: 1px solid #ddd;\n    padding-top: 8px;\n  }\n  .footer-bottom {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    font-size: 8px;\n    color: #666;\n    margin-top: 4px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"header\">\n    <div class=\"logo-left\">\n      <div class=\"logo-circle\">中国营养<br>学会标</div>\n      <div class=\"text\">中国营养学会<br>Chinese Nutrition Society</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"title-block\">\n      <h1>中国7~24月龄婴幼儿平衡膳食宝塔</h1>\n      <div class=\"subtitle\">依据《中国居民膳食指南（2022）》绘制</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"logo-right\">\n      <div class=\"text\">MCNC-CNS<br>中国营养学会妇幼营养分会</div>\n      <div class=\"logo-square\">MCNC<br>CNS<br>标志</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"main\">\n\n    <div class=\"left-col\">\n      <ul>\n        <li><span class=\"bullet-icon\"></span><span>继续母乳喂养</span></li>\n        <li><span class=\"bullet-icon\"></span><span>满6月龄开始添加辅食</span></li>\n        <li><span class=\"bullet-icon\"></span><span>从肉/肝泥、铁强化谷粉等辅食开始</span></li>\n        <li><span class=\"bullet-icon\"></span><span>母乳成的宝无需补钙</span></li>\n        <li><span class=\"bullet-icon\"></span><span>需要补充维生素D，400IU/d</span></li>\n        <li><span class=\"bullet-icon\"></span><span>回应式喂养，鼓励逐渐多样化摄食</span></li>\n        <li><span class=\"bullet-icon\"></span><span>逐步过渡到多样化膳食</span></li>\n        <li><span class=\"bullet-icon\"></span><span>辅食不加成人调料，糖和调味品</span></li>\n        <li><span class=\"bullet-icon\"></span><span>定期测量身高和身长</span></li>\n        <li><span class=\"bullet-icon\"></span><span>饮食卫生，进食安全</span></li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"center-col\">\n      <div class=\"pyramid-placeholder\">\n        [Diagram: 食物宝塔图，分层展示谷类、蔬菜水果、蛋肉类、油盐，\n        底部为坐在高脚椅上的婴儿插画，居中]\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"pyramid-caption\">\n        继续母乳喂养，逐步过渡到谷类为主食<br>\n        母乳700-500毫升&nbsp;&nbsp;母乳600-400毫升\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"right-col\">\n      <div class=\"age-headers\">\n        <span>7~12月龄</span>\n        <span>13~24月龄</span>\n      </div>\n      <table class=\"diet-table\">\n        <tr>\n          <td class=\"label\">盐</td>\n          <td colspan=\"2\">不建议额外添加 / 0-1.5克</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td class=\"label\">油</td>\n          <td>0-10克</td>\n          <td>5-15克</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td class=\"label\">蛋类<br>（至少1个蛋黄）</td>\n          <td>15-50克</td>\n          <td>25-50克</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td class=\"label\">畜禽鱼肉类</td>\n          <td>25-75克</td>\n          <td>50-75克</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td class=\"label\">蔬菜类</td>\n          <td>25-100克</td>\n          <td>50-150克</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td class=\"label\">水果类</td>\n          <td>25-100克</td>\n          <td>50-150克</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td class=\"label\">谷类</td>\n          <td>20-75克</td>\n          <td>50-100克</td>\n        </tr>\n      </table>\n\n      <div class=\"note-block\">\n        <div class=\"small\">不满6月龄添加辅食，请咨询专业人员做出决定</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"footer\">\n    中国营养学会指导<br>\n    中国营养学会妇幼营养分会编制\n    <div class=\"footer-bottom\">\n      <span>V2022-2.00</span>\n      <span>妇幼营养分会网站www.mcnutri.cn 图库文件下载</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
